{
  "id": "A-F0-inapp",
  "about": "design R3 「F0」 手机上 v10: 「另跑一次 Android 应用内全屏（Shift+F）」: triggerFullScreen(inAppFullScreen: true) as Shift+F asks it. On a phone the in-app flag changes nothing (PC triggerFullScreen: mobile hides the bars and turns the screen either way), so this records the same path through the in-app ask. Control as A-R3-rotate-hson",
